# EdSharp .gitignore
# Files produced by BuildEdSharp.cmd, or fetched by it, or built by Inno Setup,
# are reproducible and are not committed. A clone plus BuildEdSharp.cmd (and
# Inno Setup, for the installer) regenerates everything below.

# Compiled output
EdSharp.exe
EdSharp.dll
*.pdb
BuildEdSharp.log

# Pomiary z katalogu testy sa kompilowane z .cs obok nich (csc /r:EdSharpNG.exe)
/testy/*.exe

# Installer output (built from EdSharp_Setup.iss with Inno Setup)
EdSharp_Setup.exe

# Encoding-detection library fetched by FetchUde.ps1
Ude.dll

# Third-party Convert tools fetched by FetchConvertTools.ps1
/Convert/astyle/
/Convert/Pandoc/
/Convert/Tidy/
/Convert/liblouis/
/Convert/Xpdf/
/Convert/Tools.lock

# Pandoc configuration backup written by ModernizePandocConfig.ps1
*.pandoc-bak

# Scratch files
temp.txt
temp.htm
*.tmp

# Artefakty wydania (budowane lokalnie, nie wersjonowane)
dist/
EdSharp_Setup.exe
EdSharp_setup.exe
*.xlsx
EdSharpNG.exe
EdSharpNG-spellcheck.nvda-addon

# Wyniki pomiarow spisu tresci (odtwarzalne: testy/pomiar_eksportu_spisu.py)
/testy/pomiar_spisu/ze_spisem.*
/testy/pomiar_spisu/zepsuty.*
/testy/pomiar_spisu/proba*.docx
/testy/pomiar_spisu/proba*.html
list-do-jamala.md
